  holds along a derivation by composition rather than by induction done by hand.
- And the count is computed, not only proved. The small list machinery is written in the module
  (`mem-by`, `nub-by`, `filter-by`, `min-by`, `chem-map`, `chem-length`), `orbit-list` is the orbit of an
