  a residue instance and its template, an aligned segment and its homolog, a fold and its class
  representative — the store holds one representative and the identification, and recovers the other by
  transport along it. It is lossless because the identification is kept: (1.2)'s recovery `H ≃ ∑(y∶O)
  Fibₒ(y)` read as a storage law, the whole recovered exactly from the classes and what lies over each. What
  is stored per entry is then the difference from its class representative — the fiber over its fold class —
  and the factoring is the same operation as the canonicalization the chemistry document shows the field
  computing and discarding, with the automorphisms and identifications kept rather than thrown away.
